  "problem": "Which set is equivalent to $A={x\\in R:{x}^{2}+1=0}?$",
  "worked_solution": "The elements of the given set are the real numbers that satisfy the equation ${x}^{2}+1=0.$ \n\nSo, we first need to solve our equation for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}+1 & =0 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =-1 \\\\ x & =\\pm \\sqrt{-1} \\\\ x & =\\pm \\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHowever, since $x\\in R$ and $\\pm \\text{i}\\notin R,$ we conclude that the set $A$ contains no elements. Hence, $A=\u2205.$",
